(1, 64, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-25 16:44:23'),
(27, 391, 2, 'many of the small selection of arcade games available were broken or out of order. only one of the VR equipment was operating and the VR area was only open for a short amount of time during our visit. \"No staff available\" at the food cantina nor could any balls for the pool tables be found.. It was NOT worth the high ticket prices.', 'Unclean facility', NULL, '2025-08-29 01:29:00'),
(30, 527, 1, 'Hi I brought my daughter and her friend in for my daughter\'s birthday today and they\'re going to charge me $20 to sit and wait for them, she said I don\'t make the rules. The staff lady blunt and cold. I asked if they if I could just sit and wait for her and she\'s like. Nope. $20 so she said I could come in on Saturday and I wouldn\'t have to pay the $20 to sit and wait for her. I said well her birthday is today not Saturday and if I asked if there\'s a way to wave the $20 for today saying that they\'re the only two in the place and she said nope. I\'m now waiting to talk to the manager who is due back in an hour.', 'Rude staff', NULL, '2025-08-29 18:03:42'),
(305, 3497, 1, 'The waiver form has to have an easier way to enter birthdays.', 'Other', NULL, '2025-10-31 14:06:00'),
(306, 3497, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-31 14:05:13');

